Control Term Legend:
Clock         - GCK    - Global Clock
                CTC    - Block Control Term Clock
                PTC    - Product Term Clock
                CLKDIV - Clock Divider
Preset        - GSR    - Global Set
                CTS    - Block Control Term Preset
                PTA    - Product Term Preset
Reset         - GSR    - Global Reset
                CTR    - Block Control Term Reset
                PTA    - Product Term Reset
Output Enable - GTS    - Global Tristate
                CTE    - Block Control Term Output Enable
                PTB    - Product Term Output Enable

